WEBVTT

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:24.541
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:27.477
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:29.713
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:32.916
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:38.822
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.822 --> 00:00:43.426
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:55.171
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.171 --> 00:01:00.911
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.911 --> 00:01:06.583
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:12.255
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.255 --> 00:01:17.427
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.427 --> 00:01:30.795
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:31.641 --> 00:01:33.043
What's wrong?

00:01:33.043 --> 00:01:35.812
I'm... I'm...

00:01:35.812 --> 00:01:38.448
Wait... That's...!

00:01:38.448 --> 00:01:42.680
N-No! I'm not possessed!

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:48.556
It's all your fault Gerd
wound up being called a monster!

00:01:50.226 --> 00:01:52.353
That man...

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:55.096
You!

00:02:11.314 --> 00:02:13.683
There's a chance he can be...

00:02:13.683 --> 00:02:18.416
After what happened to you?
You must be crazy, Joseph.

00:02:22.993 --> 00:02:25.462
Hey! What's the deal?! Let us through!

00:02:25.462 --> 00:02:27.430
Departure from this block is forbidden!

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:30.800
What?! Explain why!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.770
West 13th Street is locked down!

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.539
North 6th Street, lockdown complete!

00:02:36.539 --> 00:02:39.376
All Squad 1 members in position!

00:02:39.376 --> 00:02:44.280
All designated areas sealed off.
Type 1 Curfew has been issued.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.817
Amanda. Hermann. Al. Brad.

00:02:47.817 --> 00:02:52.022
It's very likely that Blue has
returned to his human form, like Gerd.

00:02:52.022 --> 00:02:54.591
It's also possible he's
gotten off his motorcycle.

00:02:54.591 --> 00:02:57.994
Scour the place for anyone suspicious!

00:02:57.994 --> 00:03:01.225
I will find you!

00:03:05.468 --> 00:03:10.269
Why did he seem so much like him then?

00:03:11.975 --> 00:03:15.011
Do you honestly think you saved him?

00:03:15.011 --> 00:03:18.748
He felt different from all the other Amalgams...

00:03:18.748 --> 00:03:21.384
Block 13, all clear!

00:03:21.384 --> 00:03:24.615
Okay. Let's go to the next one.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:37.333
You can't get home now.

00:03:37.333 --> 00:03:40.103
I'll wait until the lockdown ends.

00:03:40.103 --> 00:03:44.240
Stop holding back and beat
their brains out in your other form.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.844
There's no need to
stand out more than necessary.

00:03:47.844 --> 00:03:51.648
Avoiding fighting isn't necessarily beautiful.

00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:53.850
Are you listening, Joseph?!

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:55.977
Elea.

00:03:59.622 --> 00:04:03.193
The block ahead is off-limits!

00:04:03.193 --> 00:04:05.195
Clermont Medical Pharmaceuticals.

00:04:05.195 --> 00:04:10.133
The government has hired
us to investigate the Demoniacs.

00:04:10.133 --> 00:04:13.330
Thank you for coming! Please be careful!

00:04:17.674 --> 00:04:23.544
It's progressing too slowly.
It's far from what he hoped for.

00:04:25.615 --> 00:04:27.417
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:04:27.417 --> 00:04:31.387
Martial law has been issued,
so please go home quickly.

00:04:31.387 --> 00:04:34.891
Wouldn't it be quicker to just arrest everyone?

00:04:34.891 --> 00:04:36.893
Hermann. Any luck?

00:04:36.893 --> 00:04:38.161
Nope.

00:04:38.161 --> 00:04:41.164
Block 52, all clear!

00:04:41.164 --> 00:04:42.499
Okay.

00:04:42.499 --> 00:04:46.436
Just a minute, if that's okay.
I want to call my brother.

00:04:46.436 --> 00:04:47.994
Right!

00:04:53.176 --> 00:04:54.511
Hello?

00:04:54.511 --> 00:04:58.848
Oh, hello? Malek? It's me.

00:04:58.848 --> 00:05:02.819
I don't think I'll be home
tonight. Be sure to lock up, okay?

00:05:02.819 --> 00:05:04.187
Okay.

00:05:04.187 --> 00:05:06.589
Did you go to school today?

00:05:06.589 --> 00:05:07.957
Yeah.

00:05:07.957 --> 00:05:11.294
Was everything okay?

00:05:11.294 --> 00:05:12.862
Yeah.

00:05:12.862 --> 00:05:13.930
That's good.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:18.368
Well, I think I'll be home tomorrow. Good night.

00:05:18.368 --> 00:05:20.069
Something happen to Malek?

00:05:20.069 --> 00:05:23.606
Yeah. You know how kids get into fights.

00:05:23.606 --> 00:05:26.973
But it's okay. He's a strong boy.

00:05:31.781 --> 00:05:37.554
Amanda... I'm not as strong as you think I am...

00:05:37.554 --> 00:05:40.356
Why does everyone pick on me?

00:05:40.356 --> 00:05:43.526
God hates me and Johann.

00:05:43.526 --> 00:05:48.429
Why won't He do anything?
Where is there salvation?

00:05:53.303 --> 00:05:56.339
Hello? Oh, Johann?

00:05:56.339 --> 00:06:00.877
Yeah. Say, could you lend me
that one game you were talking about?

00:06:00.877 --> 00:06:03.379
I've been wanting to play it.

00:06:03.379 --> 00:06:09.686
Oh, the Nitro Plus game?
Sure! I'll find it and bring it to you!

00:06:09.686 --> 00:06:12.889
It's rare to get a call from you, Johann!

00:06:12.889 --> 00:06:17.827
Yeah. I was worried,
after what happened yesterday...

00:06:17.827 --> 00:06:23.733
Thanks. But I'm fine now.
Because I have you as a friend.

00:06:23.733 --> 00:06:26.436
I have you as a friend, too.

00:06:26.436 --> 00:06:28.571
Well, I'll be waiting.

00:06:28.571 --> 00:06:31.870
I'll be right there! See you later!

00:06:42.752 --> 00:06:45.421
I'm on my way home! Let me through!

00:06:45.421 --> 00:06:48.558
Is it true there's a Demoniac?!

00:06:48.558 --> 00:06:52.729
Yes. Yes. I'll put in a request.

00:06:52.729 --> 00:06:58.234
An emergency vehicle in Sealed
Area 34 requests permission to pass.

00:06:58.234 --> 00:07:02.071
No exceptions allowed. Send doctors.

00:07:02.071 --> 00:07:03.373
Yes, sir...

00:07:03.373 --> 00:07:04.874
We can't help it.

00:07:04.874 --> 00:07:07.543
We wouldn't have to go through all this

00:07:07.543 --> 00:07:11.481
if we had a reliable way of
differentiating Amalgams and humans.

00:07:11.481 --> 00:07:12.482
Captain.

00:07:12.482 --> 00:07:15.318
Jil Hoffman's condition
has apparently suddenly changed

00:07:15.318 --> 00:07:17.120
after Blue's attack this afternoon.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.712
What?!

00:07:21.658 --> 00:07:24.327
Stay away! Stay away!

00:07:24.327 --> 00:07:26.763
She has?!

00:07:26.763 --> 00:07:30.324
She seems to have the same
symptoms that Matthew Grant had.

00:07:31.834 --> 00:07:37.507
Why now? Is it just individual
difference? Could it be...?

00:07:37.507 --> 00:07:42.712
She's been given a large dosage
of sedatives to calm down, but...

00:07:42.712 --> 00:07:47.617
The common link between
Gerd, Matthew, and Jil...

00:07:47.617 --> 00:07:51.020
Blood! Request a test of Jil's blood right away!

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.122
Eh? But...!

00:07:53.122 --> 00:07:55.291
If it's not just individual difference,

00:07:55.291 --> 00:08:00.163
only transmission via
blood seems to fit the situation!

00:08:00.163 --> 00:08:00.963
Boss...

00:08:00.963 --> 00:08:03.599
Alright, got it. Mei-Fong.

00:08:03.599 --> 00:08:05.301
Right!

00:08:05.301 --> 00:08:07.203
Amanda, continue your search.

00:08:07.203 --> 00:08:08.864
Understood.

00:08:31.894 --> 00:08:36.456
Time to take action, even
if you don't want to, Joseph.

00:08:57.086 --> 00:09:01.113
Where the hell are you, Blue?!

00:09:07.263 --> 00:09:12.568
Amanda, the test turned up nothing.
We still can't identify the cause.

00:09:12.568 --> 00:09:14.637
I see. Thanks.

00:09:14.637 --> 00:09:19.308
A test's a test. Situation-wise,
Amanda's hunch is right.

00:09:19.308 --> 00:09:21.110
Everyone, watch out for any blood splatter!

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.771
Understood!

00:09:27.016 --> 00:09:31.087
Excuse me. Is this your motorcycle?

00:09:31.087 --> 00:09:36.626
That's an unusual model. Where is it from?

00:09:36.626 --> 00:09:38.795
It's a Japanese Yotsubishi custom model.

00:09:38.795 --> 00:09:41.197
Nothing like German ones.

00:09:41.197 --> 00:09:45.635
Oh, it's Japanese? I've
never seen this design before.

00:09:45.635 --> 00:09:49.605
So, what are you doing here?

00:09:49.605 --> 00:09:51.766
Carving a Virgin Mary statue.

00:09:54.177 --> 00:09:58.147
May I see your driver's license?

00:09:58.147 --> 00:10:00.817
Amanda here.

00:10:00.817 --> 00:10:02.452
An Amalgam?!

00:10:02.452 --> 00:10:06.489
So Blue's finally caught
in the net! I'll be right there!

00:10:06.489 --> 00:10:09.788
For your safety, you should probably stay put.

00:10:24.841 --> 00:10:29.011
I guess you will be fine in that form.
Even though it's unbeautiful.

00:10:29.011 --> 00:10:30.213
Hey, Joseph!

00:10:30.213 --> 00:10:33.182
What are you thinking
of doing?! Don't be stupid!

00:10:33.182 --> 00:10:38.586
This is 100% an enemy trap!
What happened to not taking action?!

00:10:41.057 --> 00:10:43.259
Currently leading the citizens away!

00:10:43.259 --> 00:10:46.295
Three minutes until that 200
meter radius area turns unruly!

00:10:46.295 --> 00:10:49.732
Mei-Fong! Give me a
location to snipe the Amalgam!

00:10:49.732 --> 00:10:51.300
Sending now!

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:55.371
Found it! East 23rd District, on Main Street!

00:10:55.371 --> 00:10:56.873
Everyone, please hurry there!

00:10:56.873 --> 00:10:59.876
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:10:59.876 --> 00:11:04.680
How convenient that it shows
up where the XAT is stationed.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.750
Boss! The police unit at Sealed Area 6

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.887
appears to be locked in
combat with another Amalgam!

00:11:10.887 --> 00:11:14.152
Two, in such a small area?

00:11:22.031 --> 00:11:24.834
Contact with Point NE-04 has been lost!

00:11:24.834 --> 00:11:26.269
- Umm...!
- What is it?!

00:11:26.269 --> 00:11:29.338
- Th-There's another one...
- What?!

00:11:29.338 --> 00:11:31.040
A third one has appeared!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.008
This is insane!

00:11:43.352 --> 00:11:44.819
Johann!

00:11:45.721 --> 00:11:47.857
Johann!

00:11:47.857 --> 00:11:49.757
Here you go!

00:11:50.826 --> 00:11:54.664
Heya, Malek! Having some nighttime fun?

00:11:54.664 --> 00:11:57.934
Let us play, too.

00:11:57.934 --> 00:12:01.529
Johann said we could. Right?

00:12:03.205 --> 00:12:05.041
Ever heard of this game?

00:12:05.041 --> 00:12:10.846
The first one to beat up the
other person after the can falls wins.

00:12:10.846 --> 00:12:15.151
The one who gets beat up
doesn't lose. It builds friendship.

00:12:15.151 --> 00:12:19.451
Alright! Let's do it! Let
the friendship game begin!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:29.393
Johann! We'll let you join our group!

00:12:35.538 --> 00:12:38.407
All squads, destroy the
Amalgams! Do not let them escape!

00:12:38.407 --> 00:12:41.043
Amalgam A heading for Squad 2's snipe point!

00:12:41.043 --> 00:12:43.646
- Amalgam A sighted.
- Amalgam A sighted.

00:12:43.646 --> 00:12:45.045
Operation commence!

00:12:47.216 --> 00:12:49.752
Damn! Nimble bastard!

00:12:49.752 --> 00:12:54.256
Police and Amalgam currently
locked in combat at Sealed Area 6!

00:12:54.256 --> 00:12:55.458
Where's Squad 1?!

00:12:55.458 --> 00:12:58.394
Currently fighting a different Amalgam!

00:12:58.394 --> 00:13:01.364
Three on the loose at once?! What's going on?!

00:13:01.364 --> 00:13:04.700
Brad! Move to West B Block!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.670
Amanda and Hermann,
drive the target that way!

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:10.139
- AI, remain on standby!
- Roger!

00:13:10.139 --> 00:13:14.371
Hurry! As we speak, Sealed Area 6 is...!

00:13:24.286 --> 00:13:27.289
That's it, Johann! Beat
the crap out of that shithead!

00:13:27.289 --> 00:13:30.656
Now you're a bonafide member of this country!

00:13:37.199 --> 00:13:42.071
Alright! Nice work, Johann! Let's go!

00:13:42.071 --> 00:13:43.732
Johann...

00:13:50.279 --> 00:13:51.940
Here...

00:13:54.817 --> 00:13:56.375
Johann!

00:14:02.124 --> 00:14:06.288
Johann! You're completely one of us now!

00:15:00.382 --> 00:15:02.251
Okay! Operation complete!

00:15:02.251 --> 00:15:03.352
Confirm that it's...

00:15:03.352 --> 00:15:06.956
Squad 2, head to Sealed Area 6 immediately!

00:15:06.956 --> 00:15:09.725
An Amalgam is attacking at Point E3!

00:15:09.725 --> 00:15:11.090
Roger!

00:15:37.853 --> 00:15:39.822
Blue?!

00:15:39.822 --> 00:15:42.120
- What?!
- Are you serious?!

00:15:45.628 --> 00:15:47.596
Th-This is...

00:15:47.596 --> 00:15:49.393
Bastard!

00:15:51.867 --> 00:15:55.838
I'm at the snipe point! Keep him busy!

00:15:55.838 --> 00:15:57.499
Right!

00:16:03.913 --> 00:16:08.317
Why? Why won't he attack?

00:16:08.317 --> 00:16:11.252
After all he did to these police officers...

00:16:13.289 --> 00:16:15.655
- Take out the blade!
- You got it!

00:16:17.993 --> 00:16:19.028
Alright!

00:16:19.028 --> 00:16:20.325
Gotcha!

00:16:35.044 --> 00:16:38.070
What the...?! The damn thing's panicking!

00:16:40.349 --> 00:16:43.011
- Signal round activated!
- Alright!

00:16:49.391 --> 00:16:51.325
It just vanished!

00:16:58.667 --> 00:17:00.396
No, you don't!

00:17:06.075 --> 00:17:07.940
You're not getting away!

00:17:15.885 --> 00:17:19.521
Hello?! Are you all right?!

00:17:19.521 --> 00:17:23.514
Hold on! I'll call for help! Mei-Fong...!

00:17:32.234 --> 00:17:33.667
It couldn't be...

00:17:44.480 --> 00:17:45.514
Mei-Fong!

00:17:45.514 --> 00:17:50.185
We've lost Blue! The area
ahead is outside our live cameras!

00:17:50.185 --> 00:17:51.812
Damn!

00:18:10.673 --> 00:18:14.243
Of all the Amalgams to date,
this one's the most horrific.

00:18:14.243 --> 00:18:19.048
Squad 1 says Amalgam C fused
with a motorcycle and is on the run!

00:18:19.048 --> 00:18:21.915
I'm making Blue's removal top priority!

00:18:24.486 --> 00:18:28.081
If he had dodged and not taken that bullet...

00:18:36.632 --> 00:18:39.123
And, if...

00:18:40.769 --> 00:18:43.939
If he had kept his blood from
spraying on that mother and child...

00:18:43.939 --> 00:18:46.339
Amanda, let's go.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.375
Just coincidence?

00:19:01.123 --> 00:19:06.161
Hi, this is Amanda Werner.
Please leave your name and message.

00:19:06.161 --> 00:19:10.299
Hello, this is Milligan,
Malek-kun's homeroom teacher.

00:19:10.299 --> 00:19:13.035
Malek-kun didn't come
to school yesterday or today,

00:19:13.035 --> 00:19:17.404
so I'd like to have a meeting
with you at school, if at all possible.

00:21:47.089 --> 00:21:54.963
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.963 --> 00:22:07.075
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.075 --> 00:22:10.312
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.312 --> 00:22:17.753
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.753 --> 00:22:22.257
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.257 --> 00:22:28.830
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:34.203
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.203 --> 00:22:42.010
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.010 --> 00:22:48.350
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:50.419
Wow wow

00:22:50.419 --> 00:22:58.427
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.427 --> 00:23:05.196
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.442 --> 00:23:15.877
The man returns again.

00:23:15.877 --> 00:23:21.550
What will his fists of hatred shatter?
Lost love? Feelings for friends?

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.953
Episode 5: "The Disdained."

00:23:24.953 --> 00:23:29.253
A cold camera lens
captures the end of the hero.
